Because of the oppression of the weak and because of the groaning of the needy,","poem":1},{"text":"I will now arise,” says the LORD;","poem":2},{"text":"“I will set him in safety from those who malign him.”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The LORD’s words are flawless words,","poem":1},{"text":"as silver refined in a clay furnace, purified seven times.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"You will keep them, LORD.","poem":1},{"text":"You will preserve them from this generation forever.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"The wicked walk on every side,","poem":1},{"text":"when what is vile is exalted among the sons of men.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_webu/PSA/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_webu/PSA/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_webu/PSA/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}